        "summary": "Get Technicals Values",
        "description": "Latest value of every requested indicator for every currently-ranked instrument.\n\nComputes nothing itself (AD-F2): it dispatches to the chart's own `replay_indicator`, so a\ncolumn always equals what that coin's chart shows. ponytail: sequential per-coin catalog\nreads behind a 90s TTL cache (> the client's 60s poll, or it never hits) (one live key) -- no single-flight, add one if concurrent\nviewers ever load the box.",
        "operationId": "get_technicals_values_api_rankings_technicals_values_get",
        "parameters": [
          {
